    "bounded nonce search rejects invalid limits and a difficulty above its declared ceiling before candidate evaluation",
    "bounded nonce search accepts only exact versioned unsigned pre-work DATA and not prepared signed or decorated blocks",
    "bounded nonce search rejects descriptor hooks proxies coercion and operational limits without invocation",
    "bounded nonce search checks each found candidate through the existing full hash and fixed-nonce consumer",
    "bounded nonce search receipts are detached frozen DATA without mutating or freezing caller inputs",
    "bounded nonce search does not turn shared address-frontier work into a full payment commitment or authority",
    "bounded nonce search is deterministic on an exact explicit request and never owns retry or recovery authority",
    "bounded nonce search source captures existing consumers and excludes randomness SDK signing native owners and overflow fallback",
    "bounded nonce search qualification remains below its total65536 declared producer and reference candidate ceiling"
