    "Declared zero difficulty returns the existing placeholder with zero candidate attempts; a zero positive-work budget preserves the explicit cursor without work.",
    "Finite safe-number difficulty prefixes match an independently encoded SHA3-256 little-endian reference; success is reconsumed through the existing whole-hash and fixed-nonce validators.",
